 "label": "REPRESENTATIVE, NOT SURVEYED (plan §3.3): modern USGS 3DEP elevations with declared historical adjustments; never a 1903/1905 survey claim",
 "grids": {
  "kill-devil-hills": "kill-devil-hills-17x17-v1.json",
  "huffman-prairie": "huffman-prairie-17x17-v1.json"
 },
 "resolution_note": "v1 = 17x17 @ 125 m (EPQS point queries, zero failed points). The plan's 1-2 m heightfield is an E2.3 refinement via 3DEP raster tiles; FlatnessCertificate inputs below already come from real elevations.",
 "historical_adjustments": {
  "kill-devil-hills": [
   "Big Kill Devil Hill was a BARE SHIFTING DUNE ~100 ft in 1903 (grass-stabilized 1930s; modern ~90 ft + monument) — sim presets use the modern shape with the dune-state uncertainty axis declared",
   "the 1903 camp/launch flat lies NORTH of the hill; powered flights from level ground (telegram: 'started from level')",
   "shoreline/sound edges (0.00 m points) are modern; 1903 beach profile unknown — edges are visual-only"
  ],
  "huffman-prairie": [
   "84-acre pasture; 1904-05 tree lines differ from modern woods; the >260 m ridge on the tile edge is real terrain kept for horizon",
   "surface was rough cow pasture (hummocks) — micro-roughness is a declared uncertainty axis, not in the DEM"
  ]
 },
